@base = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

### Daftar dan filter (200)
GET {{base}}/products?halaman=1&ukuran=5&category=Wisuda

### Detail (200 / 404 jika id belum ada)
GET {{base}}/products/{{id}}

### Buat produk: jalankan sekali (201), ulangi untuk konflik SKU (409)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BKT-F1D02410080-LIVE","name":"Buket Demo Muhammad Rifqy Habibi","category":"Wisuda","description":"Latihan ETS F1D02410080","price":179000,"stock":10}

### Body kosong (400)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Harga / stok salah (400)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BKT-F1D02410080-BAD","name":"Buket Demo","category":"Wisuda","price":-10,"stock":-2}

### Edit: ganti id dengan id produk live (200)
PUT {{base}}/products/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BKT-F1D02410080-LIVE","name":"Buket Revisi Muhammad Rifqy Habibi","category":"Wisuda","description":"Revisi demo","price":180000,"stock":10}

### Pesanan dengan produk seed id 1 (201 jika id sesuai; cek dahulu GET detail)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"customerName":"Pelanggan Demo F1D02410080","quantity":2}

### Stok tidak cukup (409; jangan ada order baru)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"customerName":"Pelanggan Demo F1D02410080","quantity":999999}

### Relasi include (200)
GET {{base}}/orders

### Produk tak ada (404)
GET {{base}}/products/999999

### Hapus produk tanpa order (204, body kosong); ganti id produk live
DELETE {{base}}/products/{{id}}

### Hapus produk dengan order (409); gunakan id yang memang punya order
DELETE {{base}}/products/1
